.SS "void stumpless_close_journald_target (const struct \fBstumpless_target\fP * target)"

.PP
Closes a journald target\&. \fBThread Safety: MT-Unsafe\fP This function is not thread safe as it destroys resources that other threads would use if they tried to reference this target\&.
.PP
